      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Deaf Arts Incubator is a Deaf-led program by Inside Out Theatre that supports the development, creation, and presentation of new work by Deaf, DeafBlind, DeafDisabled, and Deaf-identified artists. Rooted in Deaf culture, language, and lived experience, the incubator provides artists with resourc"
